            <div xml:id="d36">

                <pb facs="0149" n="25" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg25"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A4/3: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Harvey</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-07-10T21:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 10, 1921—9
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 10—5:18
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>573. Your July 9, 7 p.m. Prime Minister says statement is admirable. He wholly
                    approves and I am giving out statement to newspapers here tonight for
                    publication tomorrow morning. I assume you are doing the same thing.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harvey</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
